@@ -0,0 +1,69 @@
+# CHHHS research intelligence demonstration
+
+This non-publishable workspace application demonstrates an auditable institutional
+publication monitor for Cairns and Hinterland Hospital and Health Service
+(CHHHS). It is a reference pilot under Conductor Track 36, not an official CHHHS
+publication register.
+
+## What the vertical slice does
+
+1. Builds source-specific institution searches for PubMed, Europe PMC, Crossref
+   and OpenAlex.
+2. Executes those searches through Searchright's shared provider registry and
+   retains Searchright source receipts.
+3. Preserves provider records separately, then uses `searchright-dedup` to form
+   non-destructive cross-source candidate groups.
+4. Scores attribution against a versioned institution identity profile.
+5. Applies a versioned, transparent multi-label taxonomy to titles, abstracts
+   and subject metadata.
+6. Compares current and prior canonical records with `searchright-living`.
+7. Writes one structured monthly payload as JSON, CSV, Markdown and a
+   self-contained accessible HTML dashboard.
+
+Network execution is disabled in the default build. A live run requires all of:
+
+- compilation with `--features live`;
+- the `refresh --live` command-line flag; and
+- `--acknowledge-approximate-queries`, because Crossref and OpenAlex expose
+  broad discovery rather than a complete structured affiliation search in the
+  current connector surface.
+
+## Offline demonstration
+
+```bash
+cargo run --locked -p searchright-chhhs-demo -- seed-demo \
+  --as-of 2026-08-31 \
+  --state target/chhhs-demo/state.json \
+  --output target/chhhs-demo/reports
+```
+
+The rights-clear fixtures include cross-provider duplicates, direct HHS
+metadata, facility and historical aliases, and deliberately misleading
+geographic references to Cairns. Geographic references are retained for audit
+but are not attributed to CHHHS.
+
+## Opt-in live refresh
+
+```bash
+cargo run --locked -p searchright-chhhs-demo --features live -- refresh \
+  --live \
+  --acknowledge-approximate-queries \
+  --state .searchright/chhhs/state.json \
+  --output reports/chhhs-research-intelligence
+```
+
+Optional polite-pool contact values can be supplied through `NCBI_EMAIL`,
+`CROSSREF_MAILTO` and `OPENALEX_MAILTO`.
+
+## Governance boundary
+
+The checked-in profile is deliberately conservative. It does not assert a
+complete facility hierarchy or unreviewed durable organisation identifiers.
+Before operational use, CHHHS should approve a time-bounded institution and
+facility register, adjudicate a labelled validation set, and set acceptable
+precision, recall and review-workload thresholds.
+
+The application does not retrieve restricted full text, use patient data,
+profile staff performance, or autonomously make screening or institutional
+performance decisions. A monthly report is a metadata surveillance product,
+not proof of bibliographic completeness or scientific impact.
